  "description": "The garden's Costs panels: fleet and per-project spend from the real LiteLLM bill (spend for the window, spend rate, by project, model, account, agent and role, and a tenant land's purse spend in USD). Embedded panel by panel in /garden; panel ids are fixed by the garden's embed registry. Open this to see the charts behind the farm's cost coins.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
