  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this board",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What the garden spends, from the real LiteLLM bill.** This board feeds the Costs panels inside `/garden` (one solo panel per card, plan gd-gh5J0vVbJP). The panel ids are fixed and pinned by the garden's embed registry, so **do not renumber or delete a panel**: add new ones with new ids.\n\n- **Fleet** (top): spend for the window, the fleet spend rate (the `/costs` headline query), spend by project over time, by model and by account. The window figures use `increase(...[$__range:5m])` on the same gauges the farm's cost coins read, so a card's number matches the coin for the same window (`today` is since 00:00 UTC; the board's timezone is UTC).\n- **Project** (bottom): pick `project`. The spend rate reads the project's tag gauge. By agent, by role and by model read the per-agent spend-logs gauge, an instant read of the sweep's ~48 h lookback: **those three ignore the time picker**. Land purse panels read `account=\"lands-$project\"` and are empty for operator projects.\n\nSources: `gardenio_tag_cost_usd`, `gardenio_account_cost_usd`, `gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd`. Never `gardenio_agent_spend_usd_total` (the dead at-close counter). USD figures are operator-only; tenant credits are a separate path (plan phase 3). Retention is 30 days, so the left edge of a 30 d range can be thin."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Fleet",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend (window)",
      "description": "Real LiteLLM bill for the selected window, summed over the selected projects (all projects = the fleet). Reads the per-project tag gauge gardenio_tag_cost_usd{dim=\"project\"} with the same expression the /garden farm uses for its today/week coins (farm_spend.go → costsTagGaugeSpendExpr: max by (dim, value, env) dedup, [$__range:5m] aligned subquery, each project floored at 0), so this number equals the coin for the same window. 'Today' in the garden is now/d → now in UTC. Not filtered by account: the tag gauge carries no account label. Empty means VictoriaMetrics holds no tagged spend for the selection in this window; it is not shown as $0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no bill data in this window",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(clamp_min(sum by (value) (increase((max by (dim, value, env) (gardenio_tag_cost_usd{dim=\"project\", value=~\"$project\"}))[$__range:5m])), 0))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "spend",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fleet spend rate",
      "description": "Fleet spend in USD/hour on the LiteLLM account bill (gardenio_account_cost_usd), the /costs headline query (costs_rate.go fleetHourlyRateQuery and its 1h companion): max by (account, env) dedup, aligned [W:5m] subquery, increase()/hours, E2E and probe accounts excluded. 'spend (24h avg)' is the trailing-day average; 'spend (1h)' is the trailing hour and reacts to load swings. Filtered by the account variable; all accounts = the /costs headline. Includes spend no project tag claims.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "no bill data in this window",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "axisSoftMin": 0,
            "axisPlacement": "left",
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            },
            "axisLabel": "USD / hour"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "spend (24h avg)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
